Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:13.86,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What's the current situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:16.69,Main Dialogue,O1,0000,0000,0000,,We're tracking three Savages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:19.37,Main Dialogue,O1,0000,0000,0000,,There's damage to the Zwei Island city block.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:22.15,Main Dialogue,O2,0000,0000,0000,,Evacuation of citizens is nearly complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:25.84,Main Dialogue,Meimei,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato-sama! Emile-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:27.96,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Mei-Mai? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.75,Main Dialogue,Meimei,0000,0000,0000,,I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:33.28,Main Dialogue,Meimei,0000,0000,0000,,Chris-sama, you should take your post, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.46,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.09,0:00:39.76,Main Dialogue,Meimei,0000,0000,0000,,Chris-sama is the main analyst here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:41.54,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Main analyst?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.99,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't he in middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:46.27,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Forget your average middle or high schooler,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:52.16,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,his brains and skills put him above even\NWarslarn HQ's intelligence division.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:53.48,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,He truly belongs here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.23,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:57.03,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:00.17,Main Dialogue,O1,0000,0000,0000,,We have visual on the third Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:01.29,Main Dialogue,O1,0000,0000,0000,,Putting it on the main screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:04.29,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.67,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,A giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:08.70,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,It's a Trenta-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:11.79,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Its estimated ability values are unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:13.98,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,We have to deal with one of those...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.20,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama, prepare to sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:20.55,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,On second thought, Charlotte Dimandius,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.55,0:01:24.55,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to pass on deploying Emile Crossfode\Nand Kisaragi Hayato today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:27.17,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,They may have your recommendation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:29.60,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,but they have zero experience \Nout in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:31.78,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Dealing with a normal Savage\N would be one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.78,0:01:35.05,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,but a Trenta-class is too much\N for them to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:36.57,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,So what's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.27,0:01:39.64,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Are the three of you going to\Nhead out by yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.23,0:01:45.66,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,In a few hours, a Warslarn HQ \Nsupport team will arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:47.50,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,so if we can just hold out until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:48.89,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.89,0:01:53.99,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,I never thought you would depend on\Nyour older brother, CEO Judar Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:56.84,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,My brother has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:02:01.66,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just taking the best course of action\Nas captain of the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:04.26,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're heading out, Liddy, Erica.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:06.48,Main Dialogue,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:08.87,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:10.40,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Please take us with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:13.19,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Did you not hear what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:14.87,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:19.47,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but weren't you the one who told us\Nabout believing in "noblesse oblige"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:22.83,Flashback Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,However, I believe in noblesse oblige!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.83,0:02:28.04,Flashback Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Those with power should wield it \Nfor the sake of those without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:31.64,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A long time ago, \NI was attacked by the Savage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:33.84,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,and lost part of my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:37.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,If we wait for the support team to get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,the city will just get destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:44.01,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,And so will the lives and\N memories of its residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:47.33,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure what I can do out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:50.64,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but I want you to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.07,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:56.31,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not the one who recommended\Nthat these two go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.31,0:02:57.37,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,It was LiZA.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:02:59.07,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,LiZA did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:05.33,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,She said the best way to reduce casualties and\Nraise this operation's chances of success
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:11.04,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,was for Kisaragi Hayato and Emile Crossfode\Nto sortie along with you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.53,0:03:13.04,Main Dialogue,LiZA,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:16.13,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Please let us, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:18.55,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:23.11,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:25.80,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,If that's what LiZA has determined, \NI'll have to go along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:06.24,Episode Title,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Variant {\c&H0303C1&}Awakening
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:03.53,Main Dialogue Top,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I'll be going over the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:05.85,Main Dialogue Top,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,First, Claire-sama, Liddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:09.05,Main Dialogue Top,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,and I will engage the standard \NSavage at point alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:10.49,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Once we take it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:13.54,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,we will engage the Trenta-class \Nat point gamma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:18.02,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0050,,Kisaragi Hayato and Emile Crossfode\Nare to move out then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:20.95,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0050,,Please engage the standard \NSavage at point beta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:23.42,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't we all sortie together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:26.36,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You two have zero experience \Nout on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:30.84,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We will go out ahead of you and \Nshow you how to fight the Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.84,0:05:34.02,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,In any event, once you take out \Nthe Savage at point beta,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:35.91,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,your job is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.91,0:05:38.71,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,We don't need to support you \Nwith the Trenta-class?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.32,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it looked really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.63,0:05:42.68,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't think so lowly of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:46.60,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,How many Savages do you think \Nwe've eliminated up until this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:52.12,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We've also encountered unknowns several times\Nand have taken them out each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:54.70,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Leave the Trenta-class to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:12.12,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,First we take out the Savage's vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:22.73,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liddy, Erica, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:23.86,Main Dialogue,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.36,Main Dialogue,All,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.45,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That Hundred...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:36.76,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,It's an Arsène type
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:40.48,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,which creates energy chains that can be\Nextended or retracted at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:42.86,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Its name is Everlasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:45.67,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Claire-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.30,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Claire is aiming for the Savage's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:56.31,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:57.57,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.04,0:07:02.71,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,A Savage's skin is said to be \Nas strong as steel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.71,0:07:06.40,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,but an attack from a Hundred \Ncan slice through it like butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:07.94,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That's the core!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:10.30,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,How about I finish you off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:17.70,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,I have to teach those newcomers\N not to look down on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:25.00,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Pierce through!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:29.34,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Did you see that, Emile Crossfode?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.48,0:07:38.61,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It's your turn next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:41.80,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Once you land at the coordinates, \Nhead to beta point immediately—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.80,0:07:44.01,Italics Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,We can't wait for this thing to land!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:48.73,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,The president and the others jumped off, \Nso we should follow suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:50.61,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:57.12,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! You need to hurry up \Nand deploy your Hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:58.85,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:01.46,Main Dialogue,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:11.70,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, let's try to do \Nthe same thing they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.13,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:14.64,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fire some shots to \Nprovide a smokescreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.48,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Take that chance to attack the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:19.52,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:30.99,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:41.41,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:42.88,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.73,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't get all the way to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:58.05,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:08.61,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,We did it, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.32,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:15.45,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:19.03,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Liddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:20.70,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:37.72,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liddy! Erica!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:47.89,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go save them, Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:48.73,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.34,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:53.58,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You two stand by there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.97,0:09:57.54,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I told you the student council \Nwould take care of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:58.32,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:00.04,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:13.37,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'll destroy you along with the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:18.93,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'll destroy you along with the shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:31.11,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,One more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:34.24,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,There's not enough energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:37.95,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Is that duel with Kisaragi Hayato \Nstill affecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:42.12,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.00,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:01.21,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:03.30,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:07.81,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to stand by...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:11.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can just sit there and \Nwatch one of my own get done in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.67,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What's up with your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:16.38,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:20.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:24.62,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you always steal my firsts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:27.19,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not really trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:29.09,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,My first princess carry this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:30.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That's what you're worried about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.50,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama, you're about to get hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:34.62,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.77,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, we'll have to dodge like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:37.42,Italics Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.05,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on, Erica?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:44.12,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,There's an airport in the direction \Nthe Savage is going to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:47.56,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,If you dodge, the people there that are \Ntrying to evacuate will get hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:49.74,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,President, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:51.73,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Put up a barrier and take the blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:53.82,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You should be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:57.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Guess there's no time to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:05.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to release our energy at \Nthe same time and blow the blast back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:06.41,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:08.79,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:22.56,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We did it, Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:24.30,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It's all thanks to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:27.22,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's not like I did it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:28.84,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:31.15,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you not doing so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:35.45,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's taking all my energy \Njust to keep my armaments on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:38.10,Italics Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,That's quite the nice mood \Nyou two have going on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.48,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,E-Emile?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:42.95,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to talk to you about this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.35,0:12:57.33,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:25.23,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:39.08,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Emilia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.37,0:13:40.37,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:43.93,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Wait... Did you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:45.09,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Not all of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.79,0:13:49.30,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but I know you're Emilia Hermit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:51.48,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:53.99,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You saved me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:56.00,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,We'll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.88,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia, run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:13:58.36,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:13:59.10,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:02.98,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Take the vice president for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:11.25,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.01,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Full-body armament...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.64,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same as before...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:40.25,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato....
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:46.83,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,No, Hayato!\N You can't lose yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:14.39,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Vice President!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:20.53,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Erica?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:22.40,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:25.40,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:27.78,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:30.61,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,just what has gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.37,0:15:37.61,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You can't, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:40.25,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I guess there's no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:04.19,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:05.27,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:07.78,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,We need to finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:12.25,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Channel all your energy into your\NFlying Swallow and destroy its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:13.66,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Can I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:16.28,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:19.29,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:23.53,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:54.58,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:01.70,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You did it, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:03.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:08.36,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Emile Crossfode...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:16.05,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You've... got boobs...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:18.02,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,And in the middle of combat, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:21.02,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You kissed Kisaragi Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:24.32,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Guess you found me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:45.10,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,We were able to protect all those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:46.83,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,And this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:49.85,Main Dialogue,Emilia,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that great, Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.85,0:17:50.59,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:57.72,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're able to go into combat\N because of moments like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:05.93,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,So you took out the Savage?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:08.08,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:11.33,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,The president, Emile,\N and everyone else helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:16.29,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it's unfortunate that\NSakura-san's concert got canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:18.74,Black Signs,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs16}The Savage Appeared on the Zwei Islands,\N Resulting In Damage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:18.74,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm glad no one got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:22.89,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Now you have to make up for worrying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:24.90,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:36.05,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,They told me I can keep pretending to be a guy\Nsince it would get everyone up in arms otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.59,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,The president reluctantly agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:40.36,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:43.47,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,...I can't stay in this room anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:45.14,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:48.89,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile, I want you to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.01,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:55.90,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,First, I have to talk about Variants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:18:58.65,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Variants?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.35,0:19:03.45,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,So basically, because you \Nwere attacked by a Savage,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:06.54,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,you got infected with the Savage virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:07.56,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:12.22,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,And since you tried to suck out \Nmy blood to save me, you are as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:16.12,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,The virus is potent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:18.16,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Most people die from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:20.88,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,However, if you're lucky \Nand you live through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:24.05,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,your Hundred score goes up incredibly,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:25.89,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,and you become extremely compatible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:30.99,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,People like Char call\Nthe infected people Variants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:34.48,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,There aren't even ten of us\N in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:37.72,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,So I knew I'd be able to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:42.66,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I had Char checking the Hundred tests \Nthroughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:47.20,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,So that's why you knew I'd be coming here,\Nand came to the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0} yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:52.89,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think I'd be coming to the Warslarn school\Nthat Char was assigned to, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:56.11,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But why did you have to pretend to be a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:58.83,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:02.47,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,...I wanted to be in the same room as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.36,0:20:07.12,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the only reason, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:09.75,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be bad if people found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:12.19,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you can tell me about that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.33,0:20:17.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,So, the reason I lose my memories \Nin the middle of a battle
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.69,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,is because I'm a Variant?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:22.01,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. When you're in danger of dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:25.39,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,the virus activates, you lose yourself, \Nand go on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:28.24,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It's one of the characteristics \Nof being a Variant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:30.10,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Then you too, Emile...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:34.18,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,But I've learned to control it with training.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.69,0:20:36.56,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I'll be able to do it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:37.64,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:39.81,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be able to control it \Nif you undergo training.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:41.35,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do our best together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.35,0:20:43.51,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:45.94,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:46.78,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.78,0:20:50.14,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,That day in Gudenberg, and today...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.53,0:20:53.10,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I want to thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:56.36,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I've always wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:21:00.58,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah. \NI need to make some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.58,0:21:01.86,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:08.85,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:12.07,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,If you give me a little more time, \NI wouldn't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:13.62,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.21,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,My body just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.61,0:21:19.80,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Wait. Could this be a side effect \Nof the virus activating?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:30.28,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:32.66,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,In order to suppress an activated virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:35.51,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,you need to administer an inactive virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.69,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, I just administered mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:43.22,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:46.28,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,...not like kissing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:49.20,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, that's not it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:50.47,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:01.94,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Emile Crossfode!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:04.35,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to move rooms immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:08.13,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,P-President?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.83,0:22:12.27,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Wh-What are you two doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.27,0:22:14.83,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,A-And you're on top of each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.83,0:22:17.02,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,No, we were just...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.49,0:22:28.17,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:30.70,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:33.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You took another one of my "firsts"...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:35.87,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That was an accident! An accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:38.62,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.02,0:22:41.20,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:46.06,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You know, you're being \Nstrangely nice to Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.06,0:22:48.19,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You've been kind of weird since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.19,0:22:50.47,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's totally not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:52.61,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Then why did you come here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:55.88,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to make sure you left the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:57.62,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It's my job, as student council president.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:01.03,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,If something bad happened, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.03,0:23:02.69,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Something bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.69,0:23:05.57,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You kissed Hayato yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:08.62,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, kiss me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.62,0:23:11.00,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I can't lose to the president!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.83,0:23:14.20,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it, Emile Crossfode!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:15.87,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato, you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.65,0:23:20.65,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,And why do you have a problem \Nwith Hayato and me kissing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.88,0:23:35.50,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,Too bad about the concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:36.45,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:39.28,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,It's good no one was hurt, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:41.78,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,We'll have another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.10,0:23:44.85,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,You can come to delight people\Nwith your song then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.85,0:23:45.48,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.11,0:23:50.86,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,A video of the hero Slayer \Nthat saved the Zwei Islands...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:53.34,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:05.74,Next Episode Title,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1)}Body{\c&H0303C1&}guard
